Article 38 (Encouragement of Use of Quality Food Materials) (1) Those eligible for support to encourage the use of quality food materials pursuant to Article 33(2) of the Act shall be any of the following entities and persons: <Amended on Jul. 19, 2012; Mar. 23, 2013; Feb. 19, 2021>
  1. A business entity that operates a meal service facility, as defined in subparagraph 12 of Article 2 of the Food Sanitation Act, either directly or under an outsourcing contract;
